data: {"id": "c244975d02d840dc-final", "run_id": "c244975d02d840dc", "seq": 1927, "ts_ms": 1788456775907, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h` | CrashLoopBackOff | workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h CrashLoopBackOff |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason`: `OOMKilled` (fact-1cd66a41277e) | 确认进程被内核 OOM Killer 终止 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_exit_code`: `137` (fact-4097e077c9e7) | 确认进程因 OOM 退出（信号 9） |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.resource_limit.memory`: `64Mi` (fact-1ba1a8662a73) | 确认容器内存硬限制仅为 64Mi |\n| 4 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `event.message`: `Warning  BackOff  2m12s (x454 over 120m)` (fact-759638ca9054) | 确认频繁重启导致 BackOff 机制触发 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `container_memory_usage_bytes`: `241664` bytes (236Ki) 于 17:32 (fact-c55ba718603f) | 反映容器实际使用量（236Ki）已超过内存硬限制（64Mi） |\n| 6 | Logging | Elasticsearch | Pattern: `memory allocation advanced`, numeric change: `allocated_mib` from 10 to 48 (fact-50d29dea5a18) | 确认应用存在持续增长的记忆分配行为，且 48Mi 已接近 64Mi 边界 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\nKubernetes 层面的 `OOMKilled` (fact-1) 和 `exit code 137` (fact-2) 是内存溢出的直接系统级证据，与 Prometheus 层面观测到的容器实际内存使用量 `236Ki` (fact-5) 远超其设定的 `64Mi` 限制相印证。日志记录 `allocated_mib` 从 10 增长至 48 (fact-6)，揭示了在受限资源下应用内部内存分配的持续消耗路径，构成了“资源限制过低”导致“应用被终止”的完整证据链。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器内存硬限制(64Mi)过低 → 应用内存分配持续增长至越界 → 触发内核 OOM Killer 终止进程 → CrashLoopBackOff 反复重启\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **容器内存配置过低**。\n证据表明，`workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h` 容器的 `memory limit` 仅为 64Mi (证据#3)，但日志显示应用内存分配已增长至 48Mi (证据#6)，且 Prometheus 监控显示其实际内存占用量达到 236Ki (证据#5)。这种内存使用量的持续增长触发了内核 OOM 保护机制，导致容器以 Exit Code 137 (证据#2) 被强制终止 (证据#1)，进而引发 Kubelet 频繁重启并进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态 (证据#4)。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 24.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 89.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h: 89.4s (Evidence 81.7s, RCA 7.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 124.939, "metrics": {"run_id": "c244975d02d840dc", "mttr": {"value": "2.1m", "seconds": 124.9419207572937, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "50%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.8667, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3333333333333333, "weighted_score": 0.0667}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.18, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 90%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 124941.9207572937, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 86192.40283966064, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 31361